{"id":8867093741767,"title":"Dragonfly Pattern Quilt Set, Dragonflies Vintage Quilt Set Patchwork","handle":"dragonfly-pattern-quilt-set-dragonflies-vintage-quilt-set-patchwork","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace the charm of the countryside with our Jeminise farmhouse quilt set, featuring classic patterns and soft, natural fabrics for a cozy, timeless look. Perfect for adding a touch of warmth and tradition to any bedroom, this quilt set can be personalized with a name and is available in multiple sizes.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRustic Elegance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features classic farmhouse patterns and soft fabrics for a cozy, timeless aesthetic in any bedroom.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePersonalized Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Customize with a name for a unique and thoughtful touch.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\").\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e An ideal gift for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved ones.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e Comes with 1 Quilt, with an option to add 2 Pillowcases.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e Made from Polycotton fabric for comfort and durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat for best results.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u003c\/t